<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Dongkuk Steel H1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dongkuk Steel H1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 718    vs   882</p>
<p>    Net					  15.46 vs    18.98</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			21.82 vs    25.92</p>
<p>    Turnover				  541.82 vs   539.58</p>
<p>Note - Dongkuk Steel Mill Co Ltd is a South Korea's steel producer. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
